<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches/actions/addition> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType rim:additionAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches> ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches/actions/identifier-2026-11-17> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The object identifier of this item moves from https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/touches to https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches, which resolves through w3id.org (decision of 2026-11-17); the register actions of the item move with it, under https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches/actions/. The old IRI is kept as owl:sameAs. The content of the item is unchanged. Classified clarifying: the item is the same, only its identifier changes." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-17T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:affectedProperty rim:objectIdentifier ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches/actions/meaning-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The meaning of the operation moves to the activity type https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/activity-type/touches, linked by activityType (gp:activityType). The definition no longer defines the operation; it was: \"Returns TRUE if the only points in common between this geometric object and anotherGeometry lie in the union of their boundaries: at least one boundary point in common, but no interior points in common.\"" ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches/actions/operation-sources-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The keyword ST_Touches becomes an altLabel of the activity type; the sources defining the operation move to the activity type: OGC 06-103r4 Simple Feature Access - Part 1: Common Architecture, §6.1.20; ISO/IEC 13249-3:2016 Information technology -- Database languages -- SQL multimedia and application packages -- Part 3: Spatial, §5.1.49 ST_Touches; the illustration of the operation moves to the activity type." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches/actions/representation-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "The schema copied on each input and output that had one is replaced by the representation that realizes its data type in the data-formats register (decision D6): inputs/geometry1 -> geometry-gml (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentMediaType\": \"text/xml\", \"description\": \"GML\"}); inputs/geometry2 -> geometry-gml (schema was {\"type\": \"string\", \"contentMediaType\": \"text/xml\", \"description\": \"GML\"})." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches/actions/sections-restored-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Corrects what https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches/actions/tools-2026-11-09 describes: the description sections removed then (sources, illustrations, data formats, multiplicity and the open question where present, and the Register position reference to the tier-4 process and its testbed URL) are restored. Tools and testbed stay in the prose; decision D4 applies to the model (keywords, source, properties), which carries none. Decision of 2026-11-09." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

<https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches/actions/tools-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Decision D4: 2 format keywords removed from inputs and outputs (inputs/geometry1: GML; inputs/geometry2: GML); description rewritten without tool, host or testbed. Each removed tool or testbed reference remains findable at tier 4, in bblocks-process-profiles." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType gp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://w3id.org/geolabs/ospd/generic-profiles/implementation-profile/touches> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:clarifyingChange ;
    rim:proposer gp:geolabs .

